      {
        "id": "1552373164393369702",
        "authorId": "1259124148798754907",
        "authorTag": "brooksy246",
        "content": "1. From NGC I simply want to have a medium to get our name put out there and to broaden our reach, possibly creating a triangle of services for communities, this being Northgate Studios, Vortigern and BSCH. The idea being if someone comes to NGC requiring a custom discord bot, they direct them to Vortigern, server? BSCH, and it cycles round per company. \n2. As NGC begins to develop, within 1 day of official launch BSCH has had a member come to us asking for a map, instead of the server, whom of which I could've directed to NGC whenever we're taking commissions. While all we're really looking for is getting our name out there, both benefitting mutually as we simply do what we do.",
        "attachments": [],
        "embeds": [],
        "createdAt": "2026-09-23T17:36:44.090Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "1552373497299337268",
        "authorId": "1259124148798754907",
        "authorTag": "brooksy246",
        "content": "-# also as all of hicom found out asking me to do that is a horrific idea",
